- The previous instance log for container 'app' in pod demo-s1/s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 is not available (not_found). [ev_9e686c49e7]
- The current instance log for container 'app' in pod demo-s1/s1-app-5468546b65-dvgq5 is also not available (not_found). [ev_9e686c49e7]
